{
  "_comment": "PetroPal Widgy Widget Template - Import this into Widgy app on iOS",
  "widget_type": "large",
  "name": "PetroPal - Gas Stations & Prices",
  "layers": [
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "name": "Background",
      "position": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 364, "height": 170},
      "style": {
        "background_color": "#1C1C1E",
        "corner_radius": 16
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "name": "Station Map",
      "position": {"x": 4, "y": 4, "width": 356, "height": 126},
      "data_source": {
        "type": "web_url",
        "url": "YOUR_SERVER_URL/api/map?lat={{location.latitude}}&lng={{location.longitude}}&format=redirect",
        "cache_policy": "no_cache"
      },
      "style": {
        "corner_radius": 12
      },
      "tap_action": {
        "type": "open_url",
        "url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/Petro-Canada/@{{location.latitude}},{{location.longitude}},14z"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "symbol",
      "name": "Gas Icon",
      "position": {"x": 8, "y": 134, "width": 16, "height": 16},
      "sf_symbol": "fuelpump.fill",
      "style": {
        "tint_color": "#FF9500"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Tomorrow Label",
      "position": {"x": 28, "y": 132, "width": 70, "height": 18},
      "text": "Tomorrow:",
      "style": {
        "font": "SF Pro",
        "font_weight": "regular",
        "font_size": 11,
        "text_color": "#8E8E93"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Gas Price",
      "position": {"x": 96, "y": 132, "width": 80, "height": 18},
      "data_source": {
        "type": "json_api",
        "url": "YOUR_SERVER_URL/api/widget-data?lat={{location.latitude}}&lng={{location.longitude}}",
        "json_path": "gas_price.display"
      },
      "style": {
        "font": "SF Pro",
        "font_weight": "bold",
        "font_size": 13,
        "text_color": "#FFFFFF"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Price Change",
      "position": {"x": 176, "y": 132, "width": 50, "height": 18},
      "data_source": {
        "type": "json_api",
        "url": "YOUR_SERVER_URL/api/widget-data?lat={{location.latitude}}&lng={{location.longitude}}",
        "json_path": "gas_price.change_display"
      },
      "style": {
        "font": "SF Pro Mono",
        "font_weight": "semibold",
        "font_size": 12,
        "text_color_source": {
          "type": "json_api",
          "json_path": "gas_price.color"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "symbol",
      "name": "Pin Icon",
      "position": {"x": 8, "y": 152, "width": 16, "height": 16},
      "sf_symbol": "mappin.circle.fill",
      "style": {
        "tint_color": "#FF3B30"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Nearest Station",
      "position": {"x": 28, "y": 150, "width": 240, "height": 18},
      "data_source": {
        "type": "json_api",
        "url": "YOUR_SERVER_URL/api/widget-data?lat={{location.latitude}}&lng={{location.longitude}}",
        "json_path": "stations.nearest"
      },
      "style": {
        "font": "SF Pro",
        "font_weight": "regular",
        "font_size": 11,
        "text_color": "#AEAEB2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Station Count",
      "position": {"x": 260, "y": 150, "width": 70, "height": 18},
      "data_source": {
        "type": "json_api",
        "url": "YOUR_SERVER_URL/api/widget-data?lat={{location.latitude}}&lng={{location.longitude}}",
        "json_path": "stations.count"
      },
      "text_suffix": " nearby",
      "style": {
        "font": "SF Pro",
        "font_weight": "regular",
        "font_size": 11,
        "text_color": "#8E8E93",
        "text_alignment": "right"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "symbol",
      "name": "Refresh Button",
      "position": {"x": 336, "y": 134, "width": 22, "height": 22},
      "sf_symbol": "arrow.clockwise.circle.fill",
      "style": {
        "tint_color": "#48484A"
      },
      "tap_action": {
        "type": "refresh"
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh_interval": 900,
  "setup_notes": [
    "=== PetroPal Widget Setup Guide ===",
    "",
    "1. REPLACE YOUR_SERVER_URL:",
    "   Change every 'YOUR_SERVER_URL' to your deployed PetroPal API URL.",
    "   Example: https://petropalv2-production.up.railway.app",
    "",
    "2. LOCATION-BASED (automatic):",
    "   The widget uses {{location.latitude}} and {{location.longitude}} which",
    "   Widgy replaces with your phone's real GPS coordinates on every refresh.",
    "   Make sure Widgy has Location permission: Settings > Widgy > Location > Always.",
    "",
    "3. MAP SHOWS 3 NEAREST STATIONS:",
    "   The map displays a blue 'U' marker for your location and up to 3 red",
    "   markers for the nearest Petro-Canada stations within 10 km.",
    "   Tap the map to open Google Maps and see all nearby Petro-Canada stations.",
    "",
    "4. REFRESH BEHAVIOR:",
    "   - Auto-refresh: Every 15 minutes (iOS widget limitation).",
    "   - Manual refresh: Tap the circular arrow icon (bottom-right corner)",
    "     to force an immediate refresh of location, map, and prices.",
    "",
    "5. DATA LAYERS (all use JSON endpoint data source):",
    "   - Gas Price:      json_path = gas_price.display        (e.g. '160.9 c/L')",
    "   - Price Change:   json_path = gas_price.change_display  (e.g. '+2.0c')",
    "   - Nearest Station: json_path = stations.nearest         (e.g. 'Petro-Canada - Yonge & Bloor (0.3 km)')",
    "   - Station Count:  json_path = stations.count            (e.g. '8')",
    "",
    "6. API RESPONSE (stations.top) - available for advanced use:",
    "   The API returns the 3 nearest stations as an array at stations.top[].",
    "   Each entry has: name, distance_km, display, nav_url.",
    "   You can create additional text layers to show station #2 and #3:",
    "   - 2nd station: json_path = stations.top[1].display",
    "   - 3rd station: json_path = stations.top[2].display"
  ]
}
